{"material_id": "ntce.youer.baojiao.2011b.q24.material.recovered", "text": "4岁的成成上床睡觉前非要吃糖不可。妈妈一个劲儿地向他解释睡觉前不能吃糖的道理，成成就是不听，还扯着嗓子哭起来。妈妈生气地说；“再哭，我打你。”成成不但没停止哭叫，反而情绪更加激动，干脆在床上打起滚来。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2011年下半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "fba84a07560f16722b4558b6ae79ec9a094fc9bd6d147508649929b1a4ef2b43", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1860, "decoded_csv_character_end": 1961, "next_source_question_number": 26, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2011年下半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 24, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "fba84a07560f16722b4558b6ae79ec9a094fc9bd6d147508649929b1a4ef2b43"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.youer.baojiao.2011b.q24"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.youer.baojiao.m2.k2"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.youer.ability.care"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.102.r006"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.youer.baojiao.2011b.q24"], "word_count": 100, "level": "youer", "subject": "baojiao", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2011年下半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2011年下半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "fba84a07560f16722b4558b6ae79ec9a094fc9bd6d147508649929b1a4ef2b43", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1860, "decoded_csv_character_end": 1961, "next_source_question_number": 26, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2011年下半年教师资格证考试《保教知识与能力》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 24, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "fba84a07560f16722b4558b6ae79ec9a094fc9bd6d147508649929b1a4ef2b43"}], "type": "真题", "copyright": {"authorization_status": "unknown", "holder": null, "use_scope": "re